                                "example_id": "2ca9e2f7-502a-4934-bc8f-064f90014b6c",
                                "sense_id": "9d91ba4e-76ef-38e1-87a5-3ff50429c65c",
                                "text": "You ever have a staring contest with a fish? No eyelids. Kinda pointless, right? Like you reaching for that scattergun."
